The "בוט חדשות" plugin does not collect, store, transmit or share any personal or identifying information about its users.
The plugin downloads a static and public HTML file from the GitHub repository to the user's downloads folder on their computer, and opens it as a local page. The operation is performed locally only, and does not involve sending any information about the user to any server.
